Hi!

TimeBrowse v0.2 is released!
http://sourceforge.net/projects/timebrowse/

This time "copy to desktopy" is implemented in nautilus property page.
So it comes to a little useful utility now!

Changes are following.

nilfs2_ss_manager-v0.2  Sat Feb 12 18:50:58 JST 2011
        * change default configuration file to nilfs_ss.conf (Ryusuke Konishi)
        * handle error during loading conffile (Ryusuke Konishi)
        * stop creating snapshot during shutdown (Ryusuke Konishi)
        * retry unmount for busy mount points (Ryusuke Konishi)
        * mount existing snapshots on startup

TimeBrowse-v0.2  Sat Feb 12 19:21:18 JST 2011
        * add copy to desktop button in property page
        * add size and ago property

enjoy!
